# [fn [...xs] xs] can be called with multiple positional arguments.
# The variadic param xs collects all positional args into an int-keyed Dict at runtime.
# The type checker assigns Seq(T) to xs; the runtime uses Dict (gradual typing mismatch allowed).
[f: [fn [...xs] xs]
 result: [f 10 20 30]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(xs), "result": Dict({0: Int(10), 1: Int(20), 2: Int(30)})})
